<title>HONG KONG: Cosmos Machinery 1996 net jumps 189 pct.</title>
<headline>Cosmos Machinery 1996 net jumps 189 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   21.8     vs 7.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.5	vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    44.06    vs 15.24</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,169.39 vs 1,282.83</p>
<p>    Company name		 Cosmos Machinery Enterprises Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 10-13</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Cosmos Machinery Enterprises is a machinery distributor and distilled water bottler.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is seven H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 1.5 cents) vs two cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
